  "details": "When certain users are culled and then unculled, parts of their avatar's mesh reappear in stages rather than all at once. For instance, I’ve observed one user whose clothing mesh was re-enabled before their body mesh. In the video example provided, a user's head mesh is enabled before their body mesh. This bug does appear to be minor though, as the entire avatar re-enables relatively quickly\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wp5C0UzXjaE",
